  so the handover between them is hidden below IP and the BGP session survives it. Compare with
  ixp_split_splitfabric_topology.xml, where the backup lands on a second fabric AS and the
  handover is visible to the control plane.

  No two ground/customer ASes (101, 106, 107, 108) are directly connected.

